package "main"

// A FORWARD reference to a bare iota-continuation const-group member
// (B / C below, declared after main) must resolve AND fold to the
// right iota value end-to-end (type-check + IR-gen + runtime).  The
// type checker's collectDecls forward-registers every group member so
// the reference resolves; this test additionally pins that the value
// is correct, i.e. IR-gen evaluates the iota group independent of decl
// order.  Regression guard for the const-group cross-file/forward-ref
// scoping bug (claude-todo.md).

func main() {
	println(A)
	println(B)
	println(C)
	println(B + C)
}

const (
	A int = iota
	B
	C
	D
)
